  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OBJECTIVES:NETWORK OF OCEAN AMBASSADORS AND OCEAN GUARDIANS; INCREASED RESEARCH CAPACITY; ENHANCED PROTECTION; ALTERNATIVE LIVELIHOODS FOR FISHERMEN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MMF&#x2019;s research, education and conservation work in Tofo, Rocha, Barra, Bazaruto and Morrungulo will be strengthened by MMF - existing activities will be further scaled up across five key programmes. 1. A network of passionate and influential Ocean Ambassadors (influential community leaders). 2. A generation of Ocean Guardians (young people mainly women from the communities), who understand and cherish the ocean. 3. Increased national research capacity. 4. Enhanced capacity to monitor and enforce protected areas. 5. Alternative livelihoods for fisher folk to reduce their reliance on destructive fishing methods.</narrative>
  </description>
